OL,3,GNEWSAFemale DJs call out 'blatant
OL,4,Amisogyny' and harassment in nightlife
OL,5,Ascene
OL,6,
OL,7,FFemale DJs have described experiencing
OL,8,F"blatant misogyny", harassment and
OL,9,Fintimidation while performing and said
OL,10,Fwomen are often treated as "guests"
OL,11,Frather than professionals behind the
OL,12,Fdecks.
OL,14,FAnna McAteer, Andrea Shearer and Julie
OL,15,FDunne have all spoken about experiences
OL,16,Franging from unwanted interference with
OL,17,Fequipment and inappropriate comments to
OL,18,Fphysical intimidation.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,419,410,260,120,0,100
