OL,3,GNEWSAFemale DJs call out 'blatant
OL,4,Amisogyny' and harassment in nightlife
OL,5,Ascene
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey said the problem reflects wider
OL,8,Fattitudes towards women working in
OL,9,Fnightlife, rather than being the fault
OL,10,Fof the venues and promoters themselves.
OL,12,FShearer said she had "never really seen
OL,13,Fit happen to a male colleague".
